    "updated_at": "2017-01-10T14:21:55Z",
    "body": "Just descendant of form is not sufficient. Controls can be associated with a form without being descendants. Is the problem just in select? I guess datalist could also be a problem, but less so. Another option could be to change the parser to ignore plaintext in select, although there is resistance against changing the parser in general...",
